# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/omit.owl/MCO_0000867> (is rich medium for)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/omit.owl/MCO_0000867> "a relation between a culture medium and an organism, in which the medium contains all the elements that the specific organism needs for growth and is non-selective, so it is used for the general cultivation and maintenance of the organism kept in laboratory culture collections")
